                <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="/project/2/">Value proposition</a></li>
                <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="/project/3/">Build a team</a></li>
                <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="/project/4/">Data</a></li>
                <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="/project/5/">Solution design</a></li>
                <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="/project/6/">Evaluation</a></li>
                <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="/project/7/">Adoption</a></li>
